WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:16.600
Well, I've been having a lot of
fun doing these video podcasts
and bringing them to you via

00:16.600 --> 00:20.080
the Daily Source Code podcast
feed.

00:20.080 --> 00:24.920
And on this episode, I want to
share some work with you that
was done by a very, very good

00:24.920 --> 00:26.440
friend of mine from the
Netherlands.

00:26.440 --> 00:33.040
We worked together on a reality
show called The Addams Family,
which was broadcast on Dutch

00:33.040 --> 00:38.880
television about three years ago
now after the big success of the
Osborns.

00:38.880 --> 00:40.800
They offered us that.

00:40.800 --> 00:47.480
And what was great about Katja
is that when I met her, she was
using the type of tools

00:47.480 --> 00:50.160
that I wanted to use for this
production.

00:50.160 --> 00:52.480
We didn't want to go into big
video editing suites.

00:52.480 --> 00:58.480
We wanted to do it on our Macs
with Final Cut Pro and Pro Tools
and using Firewire Drives.

00:58.480 --> 01:04.760
And we've dreamt a lot about
doing cool video stuff, and
she's always been way ahead of

01:04.760 --> 01:06.000
me on that.

01:06.000 --> 01:09.400
I think her day just might be
around the corner.

01:09.400 --> 01:11.960
We're getting to be able to do
some pretty cool stuff.

01:11.960 --> 01:14.120
So Katja, you rock my world.

01:14.120 --> 01:15.280
Thanks for the leader.

01:15.280 --> 01:18.000
Thanks for the bumper, which
everyone will see at the end.

01:18.000 --> 01:19.960
And thanks for the implant,
honey.

01:21.250 --> 02:18.750
[ Music ]

02:22.480 --> 02:24.480
Guys, get ready for the Saturday
night.

02:32.000 --> 02:34.560
Another pod show video podcast.

02:34.560 --> 02:35.840
Stick it on your screen.
